    "obs_and_metrics": [],
    "innovation": "This paper presents a method using response theory from statistical mechanics to predict global and spatial climate change, creating response operators from test simulations that project the climate's reaction to arbitrary CO2 forcing scenarios without requiring new, dedicated model runs.",
